"<p>Quick guide to the tabs on this page -- Microsoft/Ingram licensing across all clients.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Ingram Subscriptions</b> -- search by client and/or subscription name to see active/pending Ingram Micro licensing. Click a client's name to load license counts for their subscriptions.</li>\n<li><b>Ingram Orders</b> -- pick a date to see Ingram Micro orders placed since then -- new sales, seat changes, cancellations.</li>\n<li><b>M365 Environment</b> -- type a client name to see their Microsoft 365 tenant snapshot from IT Glue: domains, licenses, and admin roles.</li>\n<li><b>CSP Customers</b> -- browse or search the full list of CSP customers and their Microsoft tenant IDs.</li>\n</ul>"